SCENE: A sunlit traditional Indian courtyard. A single stone arch stands beyond her, seen past her head, with pillars on either side, background softly blurred. Hair tied back in a neat low bun so the back neckline of the blouse is visible. Styled with gold jhumka earrings, a gold choker-style necklace, and bangles. Warm, golden directional lighting.

OUTPUT: Return only the image: ONE photograph in portrait orientation, 3:4, taller than wide, with the one model filling the frame. Not a pair of views, not a grid, not a collage. No caption, no notes, no commentary."
